    "FriendlyName": "DLSS 5 for UE5",
    "Description": "Independent UE5 D3D12 integration for NVIDIA Neural Rendering. Viewport controls and integrated Movie Render Queue output with frame-aligned depth/motion guides. Local distribution based on Praveen Kumar v0.6.1.",
